WEBVTT

00:25:26.804 --> 00:25:32.216
or try to figure out what could I do
that would make people light me up.

00:25:32.240 --> 00:25:33.776
AG: This is Jane Dutton.

00:25:33.800 --> 00:25:35.474
She was my dissertation chair,

00:25:35.498 --> 00:25:38.613
and she has a remarkable gift
for making connections with people

00:25:38.637 --> 00:25:40.221
and for people.

00:25:40.245 --> 00:25:42.596
If the University of Michigan
was a solar system,

00:25:42.620 --> 00:25:44.436
she'd be the sun.

00:25:44.460 --> 00:25:48.386
Jane was the one who introduced me
to the idea of a microcommunity.

00:25:48.410 --> 00:25:50.546
She doesn't just nurture relationships.

00:25:50.570 --> 00:25:52.566
She studies them, too.

00:25:52.590 --> 00:25:54.806
Her specialty is high-quality connections.

00:25:54.830 --> 00:25:57.233
JD: I mean, you know them subjectively

00:25:57.257 --> 00:25:59.516
because they literally light you up.

00:25:59.540 --> 00:26:02.989
They leave you in the moment
feeling more energized